          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the days of Shamgar the son of Anath, in the days of Jael, the highways were unoccupied, and the travellers walked through byways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "The inhabitants of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.5.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.5.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the villages ceased, they ceased in Israel, until that I Deborah arose, that I arose a mother in Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They chose new gods; then",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.5.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.5.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "war in the gates: was there a shield or spear seen among forty thousand in Israel?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.5.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.5.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "toward the governors of Israel, that offered themselves willingly among the people. Bless ye the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
