            "sid": "JDG 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awake, awake, Deborah: awake, awake, utter a song: arise, Barak, and lead thy captivity captive, thou son of Abinoam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he made him that remaineth have dominion over the nobles among the people: the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.5.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.5.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made me have dominion over the mighty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Out of Ephraim",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.5.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.5.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a root of them against Amalek; after thee, Benjamin, among thy people; out of Machir came down governors, and out of Zebulun they that handle the pen of the writer.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the princes of Issachar",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.5.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.5.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with Deborah; even Issachar, and also Barak: he was sent on foot into the valley. For the divisions of Reuben",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JDG.5.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JDG.5.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great thoughts of heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
